│                          │ trend-direction stabilization. It preserves endpoint-aligned output length while reducing │
│                          │ noise-driven reversals without introducing moving-average phase delay. The basic          │
│                          │ algorithm is also vectorized with cumulative sums for efficient sliding-window averaging. │
