│ patch_description        │ This redesign replaces the monolithic filter loop with a staged causal pipeline: a robust │
│                          │ local-linear endpoint estimator produces low-lag observations, an adaptive alpha-beta     │
│                          │ tracker removes noise, and a persistence-based direction controller confirms reversals    │
│                          │ before permitting output direction changes. The output is additionally                    │
│                          │ direction-constrained between confirmed turns, reducing noise-induced slope reversals     │
│                          │ while retaining prompt response to sustained signal changes. The public functions,        │
│                          │ arguments, return lengths, and result dictionary format remain unchanged.                 │
